1:["$","main",null,{"className":"reading-page post-reading-page","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"post-article h-entry","children":[["$","$L7",null,{"className":"u-url sr-only","href":"/blog/rust-bootcamp","children":["Rust 训练营总结丨第三次入门 Rust"," 永久链接"]}],["$","a",null,{"className":"p-author h-card sr-only","href":"https://github.com/hedon954","rel":"author","children":"Hedon"}],["$","figure",null,{"className":"article-hero article-cover","children":["$","img",null,{"className":"u-photo","src":"https://hedon.top/hedonspace/banner/rust-bootcamp.jpg","alt":"Rust 训练营总结丨第三次入门 Rust 的文章封面"}]}],["$","header",null,{"className":"article-header article-summary-row","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow","children":"rust"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"p-name","children":"Rust 训练营总结丨第三次入门 Rust"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"article-deck p-summary","children":"本文记录了我在 Rust 训练营的学习历程，也映射了我 2024 年全年的成长轨迹。"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-meta","children":[["$","time",null,{"className":"dt-published","dateTime":"2024-11-26T19:10:08.000Z","children":["发布于 ","2024/11/26"]}],"$undefined",["$","span",null,{"children":"$undefined"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["约 ","2,286"," 字"]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-layout","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"article-reading-column","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"e-content","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"markdown-body","children":[["$","h2","h2-0",{"id":"缘起","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#缘起","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#缘起"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"缘起","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":4,"offset":3},"end":{"line":1,"column":6,"offset":5}}}]},"children":"缘起"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"2023 年我给自己定了很多个目标，最终的结果是每个都做了一些事情，但是没有一个是做得比较彻底的，印证了《孙子兵法》的那句：“无所不备，则无所不寡”。"}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"在 2023.10.23 出于好奇，我订阅了《Rust 语言从入门到实战》的专栏，跟着课程的更新节奏学习完了整个专栏。"}],"\n",["$","$L8","img-0",{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/Rust%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80%E4%BB%8E%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8%E5%88%B0%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98%E7%BB%93%E8%AF%BE%E8%AF%81%E4%B9%A6.png","alt":"Rust语言从入门到实战结课证书","style":{"zoom":"33%"},"node":{"type":"element","tagName":"img","properties":{"src":"https://hedonspace.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/img/Rust%E8%AF%AD%E8%A8%80%E4%BB%8E%E5%85%A5%E9%97%A8%E5%88%B0%E5%AE%9E%E6%88%98%E7%BB%93%E8%AF%BE%E8%AF%81%E4%B9%A6.png","alt":"Rust语言从入门到实战结课证书","style":"zoom:33%;"},"children":[],"position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1,"offset":145},"end":{"line":7,"column":223,"offset":367}}}}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":"虽然我第一次入门 Rust 失败了，但也被 Rust 的种种特性所吸引。我是个特别喜欢“痛苦前置”的人，而 Rust 编译器\"睚眦必报\"的编译器检查正给予了我被虐的爽感，编译通过后程序的稳定运行也符合我追求成为一位“靠谱”工程师的愿景。"}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":"加之我的主力语言是 Go，一门应用编程语言，所以我一直希望学习一门系统编程语言，以期将来有能力窥探一些底层的细节原理。C/C++ 太古老了，特性太多了，大神太多了，我怎么学都不可能赶得上别人，嘿嘿，学个新的，大家都没学过，这不就舒服了么。"}],"\n",["$","p","p-4",{"children":["后来极客时间决定开设《Rust 训练营》，讲师是",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"https://www.zhihu.com/people/tchen","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://www.zhihu.com/people/tchen"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"陈天","position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":26,"offset":635},"end":{"line":13,"column":28,"offset":637}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":13,"column":25,"offset":634},"end":{"line":13,"column":65,"offset":674}}},"target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"陈天"}],"老师，我去搜了关于陈天老师的一些资料，看了一些他写的文章和技术分享视频，甚至油管上还有他之前面试的视频。OK，这个人得到了我的认可，我想跟这样的人交个朋友，哪怕只是加个微信，至少我多了个口子，得以窥探精英阶层人士的生活一角。"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-5",{"children":["结合 2023 年的教训，2024 年年初我就给自己制定了一年的目标，只有一个，就是",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"踏踏实实、完完整整学习完整个 Rust 训练营，其他所有事情和目标，都要为其让步"}],"。"]}],"\n",["$","blockquote","blockquote-0",{"children":["\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":"其实是 2 个目标 hhh，另外一个目标是：完成人生的第一场半程马拉松。"}],"\n"]}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-1",{"id":"筑基","children":["$","a","a-0",{"href":"#筑基","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"#筑基"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"筑基","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":4,"offset":920},"end":{"line":19,"column":6,"offset":922}}}]},"children":"筑基"}]}],"\n",["$","p","p-6",{"children":["为了更好服务于《Rust 训练营》，在 1-4 月份，我花了差不多 3 个多月的时间啃下了",["$","a","a-0",{"href":"https://book.douban.com/subject/36547630/","node":{"type":"element","tagName":"a","properties":{"href":"https://book.douban.com/subject/36547630/"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"《Rust 程序设计（第二版）》","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":47,"offset":970},"end":{"line":21,"column":63,"offset":986}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":46,"offset":969},"end":{"line":21,"column":107,"offset":1030}}},"target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","children":"《Rust 程序设计（第二版）》"}],"，对整个 Rust 的语言特性建立了更加完善的体系基础，也多奠定了一些基础，当然，这是我第二次入门 Rust 失败。"]}],"\n","$L9","\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$L10","\n","$L11","\n","$L12","\n","$L13","\n","$L14","\n","$L15","\n","$L16","\n","$L17","\n","$L18","\n","$L19","\n","$L1a","\n","$L1b","\n","$L1c","\n","$L1d","\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\n","$L23","\n","$L24","\n","$L25","\n","$L26","\n","$L27","\n","$L28","\n","$L29","\n","$L2a","\n","$L2b"]}]}],"$L2c","$L2d","$L2e"]}],"$L2f"]}]]}]}]
